# Gradual ramp materials (2-6 Myr): each step multiplies permeability by
# 10^0.1 (~1.2589) every 200,000 yr, so the two remaining decades of
# aquifer/cap permeability increase (1e-12 -> 1e-10) are spread across
# 20 small steps instead of the two instantaneous 10x jumps used above.
MATERIAL_PROPERTY aquifer_ramp01
  ID 10
  POROSITY 0.10d0
  TORTUOSITY 1.d0
  ROCK_DENSITY 2700.d0 kg/m^3
  SPECIFIC_HEAT 1000.d0 J/kg-C
  THERMAL_CONDUCTIVITY_DRY 2.0d0 W/m-C
  THERMAL_CONDUCTIVITY_WET 2.0d0 W/m-C
  PERMEABILITY
    PERM_ISO 1.2589d-12
  /
